{"title":"Chemistry competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This is a resources page for students interested in <b>Chemistry competitions</b>.  Please add quality resources.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Chemistry_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Chemistry competitions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Local_Chemistry_Olympiad\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Local Chemistry Olympiad</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#National_Chemistry_Olympiad\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National Chemistry Olympiad</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Washington_University_Chemistry_Tournament(WUCT)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Washington University Chemistry Tournament(WUCT)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Books</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Online_Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Online Resources</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chemistry_competitions\">Chemistry competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Chemistry competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://portal.acs.org/portal/acs/corg/content?_nfpb=true&amp;_pageLabel=PP_SUPERARTICLE&amp;node_id=2273\">United States National Chemistry Olympiad</a>, run by the American Chemical Society\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Local_Chemistry_Olympiad\">Local Chemistry Olympiad</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Local Chemistry Olympiad\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Nearly 16,000 U.S. students participate in Local Chemistry Olympiad competitions. Over 70% of Local Sections use the Local Section Exam prepared by the ACS Chemistry Olympiad Examination Task Force. Exams are administered annually in March and students are nominated for the U.S. National Chemistry Olympiad competition based on their performance.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_Chemistry_Olympiad\">National Chemistry Olympiad</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National Chemistry Olympiad\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The U.S. National Chemistry Olympiad national exam (USNCO) is a 3-part, 4 hour and 45 minute exam administered in mid or late April by ACS Local Sections. Approximately 1000 students qualify from local exams to take the USNCO.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Washington_University_Chemistry_Tournament.28WUCT.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Washington_University_Chemistry_Tournament(WUCT)\">Washington University Chemistry Tournament(WUCT)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Washington University Chemistry Tournament(WUCT)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books\">Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>USNCO National preparation:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1319137989/artofproblems-20\">Chemical Principles: The Quest for Insight</a> by Atkins, Jones, Laverman, Patterson, and Young.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1535884495/artofproblems-20\">Chemical Principles</a> by Steven Zumdahl and Donald J. DeCoste.</li>\n<li><i>General Chemistry; Volumes I &amp; II</i> by Charles E.Mortimer</li>\n<li><i>Organic Chemistry</i> by David Klein</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0199270295/artofproblems-20\">Organic Chemistry</a> by Jonathan Clayden, Nick Greeves, and Stuart Warren.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\nHigh School A.P. and Honors courses:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/035785067X/artofproblems-20\">Chemistry</a> by Zumdahl, Zumdahl, and DeCoste.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Online_Resources\">Online Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Online Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifylabs.com/\">CompetifyLabs</a> Custom-made topic-tailored problems across chemistry preparation across honors chem to USNCO/IChO level - earn volunteer hours from problem writing!</li>\n<li>CompetifyHub's Problem Sets <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://competifyhub.com/services-2/\">Free Competition and Learning Resources for Grades 1-12</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/community/c162_chemistry\">Chemistry Forum</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a>.</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.com/school/course/woot-chem\">ChemWOOT</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.iuventa.sk/en/subpages/icho/PAST-COMPETITION-TASKS.alej\">Past IChO Problems and Answers</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_books\" title=\"Chemistry books\">Chemistry books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_scholarships\" title=\"Chemistry scholarships\">Chemistry scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_competitions\" title=\"Science competitions\">Science competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018080314\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 25/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1473:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018080314 and revision id 277173. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}